<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n526" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăcĭnus</span></b> , i,
			m., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ăcĭnum</span></b> , i,
		n., partic. in plur. acina, orum (also
			ăcĭna, ae, f., <i><span class="en">Cat. 27,
		4</span></i>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A berry</i>, esp. <i>the grape</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Col.
				11, 2, 60</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also: hederae sambucique,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 15, 24, 29, § 100
				sq.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cissanthemi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 25, § 116</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ligustri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib.
					24, 74</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trychni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 21, § 177</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Per
			meton., <i>the stone of a berry</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Sen.
				15, 52</span></i>.</div>
